  <Comments>swimming or walking in air script 
if activate this script when you located under water 
then you can swim in air, while script are activated 
for get exploit which allow walk in air 
need activate this script when you stand near to boat 
if you noticed that camera view was changed on more near 
it means you got this 
if now activate script flying 
then you can walk or run in air 
if deactivate script flying 
you not start fall down immediately 
but it similar on gradually descent 
i recommend activate script camera distance 
for fix camera view 
and also script high speed 
for getting normally speed 
enjoy :) 
ground height script 
if activate this script and flying script 
then you also can walk or run in air 
but in this case camera view not change 
and others personages not can walk on air 
</Comments>
